  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 3, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.7, "A": 0.7, "C": 0.7, "V": 0.8},
  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据：'As defined in the approach of CIGRE Working Group 34.03 into data flows within Substations. [3]' – 这个短语不完整，且与后续定义未良好整合，导致整体结构混乱，难以理解其目的和上下文。",
    "A": "证据：'Protocol The rules for communication system operation that must be followed if communication is to be effected.' – 定义相对明确，但'if communication is to be effected'可能略有歧义，指代不清；其他定义如'Reliability'来自标准来源，整体无重大歧义。",
    "C": "证据：引用标记[2]和[3] – 需求依赖于外部标准定义（如CIGRE WG 34.03），假设正确，但未提供具体验证或上下文，可能影响正确性评估。",
    "V": "证据：'Reliability The ability of a functional unit to perform a required function under stated conditions for a stated period of time.' – 这是一个定义性陈述，没有指定可测试的指标、条件或方法，因此无法直接验证或测试。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "改写为清晰的定义列表：'Define the following terms for the system: Protocol: The rules for communication system operation that must be followed to enable communication. [2] Quality of Service (QoS): A set of characteristics of a connection described in terms of QoS parameters, normally negotiated between peer entities. [2] Reliability: The ability of a functional unit to perform a required function under stated conditions for a stated period of time. [2] Remote control: Control of an operation from a distance. [2]'",
    "A": "保持不变，或轻微改进：澄清'effected'为'enabled'，例如'Protocol: The rules for communication system operation that must be followed to enable communication. [2]'。",
    "C": "验证参考文献[2]和[3]的正确性，或指定标准版本以增强可靠性。",
    "V": "改写为可测试的需求：例如，将定义与具体测试指标关联，如'Reliability shall be measured as 99.9% uptime over a stated period, with conditions defined in test plan.'但需根据上下文调整。"
  },
  "issues": [
    {
      "type": "U",
      "evidence": "'As defined in the approach of CIGRE Working Group 34.03 into data flows within Substations. [3] Protocol The rules for communication system operation that must be followed if communication is to be effected. [2]'",
      "rewrite": "'Define the following terms as per references: Protocol: The rules for communication system operation that must be followed to enable communication. [2] Quality of Service (QoS): A set of characteristics of a connection described in terms of QoS parameters, normally negotiated between peer entities. [2] Reliability: The ability of a functional unit to perform a required function under stated conditions for a stated period of time. [2] Remote control: Control of an operation from a distance. [2]'"
    },
    {
      "type": "V",
      "evidence": "'Reliability The ability of a functional unit to perform a required function under stated conditions for a stated period of time.'",
      "rewrite": "'Specify Reliability with testable parameters: The system shall achieve a reliability of at least 99.9% uptime over a period of one year, under conditions defined in the operational environment, as measured by [specific test method].'"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.95, "A": 0.95, "C": 0.85, "V": 0.98},
  "rationales": {"U":"需求文本实为术语定义集合（'Protocol', 'Quality of Service (QoS)', 'Reliability', 'Remote control'），无统一主语、无行为动词、无上下文约束，且混排参考文献标记[2][3]与断行拼写错误（'ap- proach', 'conn ection'），导致读者无法识别该条目是系统功能需求、接口约束还是术语表；证据片段：'As defined in the ap- proach of CIGRE Working Group 34.03...'、'Protocol The rules for communication system operation...'；此类碎片化定义堆砌违反ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148对需求原子性与意图明确性的基本要求","A":"'Protocol'定义中'rules... that must be followed if communication is to be effected'含模糊情态动词'must be followed'但未指明遵循主体（设备？配置工具？运行时协议栈？）、违反后果及检测方式；'Reliability'定义引用通用标准表述'under stated conditions for a stated period of time'，但未声明本系统中'conditions'和'time'的具体取值（如：环境温度-25°C~70°C，连续运行72小时）；证据片段：'must be fol- lowed if communication is to be effected'、'under stated conditions for a stated period of time'","C":"定义整体源自CIGRE/IEC标准术语，核心概念（如Reliability、QoS）在电力自动化领域有共识，未发现事实性错误；但'Remote control'定义'Control of an operation from a distance'过于宽泛，未体现变电站场景特异性（如IEC 61850中SCD配置驱动的GOOSE/SV远程操作），属局部不完整而非错误，故Correctness得分略高于其他维度","V":"所有定义均无可观测、可测量、可判定的验收准则：例如'Reliability'未给出MTBF阈值或故障率上限；'QoS'未指定时延≤10ms、抖动≤1ms、丢包率<0.001等参数；'Remote control'未定义命令确认超时时间、双确认机制或防误闭锁逻辑；证据片段：'A set of characteristics of a conn ection described in terms of quality of service (QoS) parameters, normally negotiated between peer entities'——'normally negotiated'非确定性描述，无法测试"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"将本条拆分为独立、编号的原子需求项（如R1.1–R1.4），每项以'System shall...'开头，明确主语、行为、对象及约束；删除参考文献标记与拼写错误；合并术语定义至附录，本节仅保留可执行需求","A":"Rewrite 'Protocol' as: 'The system shall implement IEC 61850-8-1 MMS protocol over TCP/IP, enforcing RFC 5905-based timestamp synchronization and rejecting packets with invalid APDU length fields.'；Rewrite 'Reliability' as: 'The system shall achieve ≥99.99% availability under ambient temperature -25°C to +70°C, measured over 12 consecutive months of operation.'","C":"保持不变","V":"Rewrite 'QoS' as: 'For all GOOSE messages carrying trip commands, end-to-end latency shall be ≤4 ms with jitter ≤100 μs and packet loss rate = 0, measured using IEC 61850-10 conformance test suite TC12.'；Rewrite 'Remote control' as: 'Upon receipt of a valid SBO (Select Before Operate) command, the system shall respond with positive confirmation within 100 ms; if no response is received within 500 ms, the system shall auto-cancel the select state and log event ID RC_ERR_TIMEOUT.'"},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"As defined in the ap- proach of CIGRE Working Group 34.03 into data flows within Substations. [3] Protocol The rules for communication system operation that must be fol- lowed if communication is to be effected. [2]","rewrite":"R1.1 The system shall implement data flow modeling for substation automation systems in accordance with CIGRE TB 670 (2017), Section 4.2, representing all IED-to-IED logical connections via standardized CDCs (e.g., Pos, SPS, DPS)."},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"Reliability The ability of a functional unit to perform a required function under stated conditions for a stated period of time. [2]","rewrite":"R1.3 The system shall maintain uninterrupted operation of all protection functions for ≥72 consecutive hours when subjected to thermal cycling between -25°C and +70°C, verified by accelerated life testing per IEC 60068-2-14."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"Remote control Control of an operation from a distance.","rewrite":"R1.4 The system shall execute remote control commands issued from the station HMI with round-trip latency ≤200 ms (95th percentile) and support mandatory two-step SBO (Select-Before-Operate) logic, where failure to receive operate command within 30 s after select shall trigger automatic select cancellation and event log 'RC_SBO_TIMEOUT'. "}
  ]
}
